text: ["Bestow {2}{B}{B} (If you cast this card for its bestow cost, it's an Aura spell with enchant creature. It becomes a creature again if it's not attached to a creature.)\\nNighthowler and enchanted creature each get +X/+X, where X is the number of creature cards in all graveyards.", 'Heroic — Whenever you cast a spell that targets Phalanx Leader, put a +1/+1 counter on each creature you control.', '{T}: Add an amount of {G} equal to your devotion to green. (Each {G} in the mana costs of permanents you control counts toward your devotion to green.)']
